est?','Azure SQL Database — managed relational DB with automated backups and scaling.','Azure Cosmos DB — globally distributed multi-model NoSQL database.','Azure Blob Storage — object store for unstructured data.','Azure Synapse Analytics — analytics and data warehousing platform.','Azure Table Storage — key-value store for simple workloads.','On-premises SQL Server managed by customer.','single_choice','B','The selected option is the most appropriate managed Azure service for the stated requirement; other options may be plausible but don\'t fully satisfy the constraints.','Other choices are partially correct but miss key requirements from the scenario.','Relational Data on Azure','Relational Data on Azure Fundamentals','Scenario-based','4',0,0,'relational_data_on_azure','N/A','N/A',1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6,1,'Active',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2025-11-13 13:55:29',4,'2025-11-13 13:55:29'),(749,536,42,13,'FROM_EXAM',59,'Mock 1',2,'Azure',23,'DP-900: Microsoft Azure Data Fundamentals','Mock 1','Q59. A data engineering team must run interactive analytics on petabytes of telemetry and expose dashboards. Which Azure service provides serverless, scalable analytics and integrates with Power BI?','Azure SQL Database — managed relational DB with automated backups and scaling.','Azure Cosmos DB — globally distributed multi-model NoSQL database.','Azure Blob Storage — object store for unstructured data.','Azure Synapse Analytics — analytics and data warehousing platform.','Azure Table Storage — key-value store for simple workloads.','On-premises SQL Server managed by customer.','single_choice','D','The selected option is the most appropriate managed Azure service for the stated requirement; other options may be plausible but don\'t fully satisfy the constraints.','Other choices are partially correct but miss key requirements from the scenario.','Analytics Workloads on Azure','Analytics Workloads on Azure Fundamentals','Scenario-based','3',1,0,'analytics_work