heck_circle</span>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm\">Write\n  clean, efficient code and follow best practices</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800\n  p-3 rounded-lg\">\n            <span class=\"material-icons text-blue-600\n  dark:text-blue-400\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\">verified</span>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm\">Test\n  applications for functionality, performance, and security</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800\n  p-3 rounded-lg\">\n            <span class=\"material-icons text-blue-600\n  dark:text-blue-400\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\">lightbulb</span>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm\">Suggest\n   improvements to enhance usability and scalability</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 border-l-4\n  border-blue-600\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"material-icons text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\"\n   style=\"font-size: 22px;\">schedule</span>\n          <div>\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\n  mb-1\">Commitment</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm\">8\n  hours/day of productive work with flexible scheduling</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,4,'2025-10-03 14:18:57','2025-10-27 15:39:00'),(40,44,'MIDDLE','Who Should Apply','<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem;\n  padding-bottom: 4rem;\">\n    <section class=\"text-white rounded-xl shadow-xl p-6\"\n  style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(79, 70, 229),\n  rgb(126, 34, 206));\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white/20 p-2 rounded-lg\">\n          <sp