Pricing:</strong> All prices are clearly stated on    \n   the platform. Genospark reserves the right to change its pricing at    \n   any time.\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            <strong>Refunds:</strong> All refund requests are handled     \n  according to our separate <a\n  href=\"https://genospark.in/refund-policy\" class=\"text-blue-600\n  dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline\">Refund Policy</a>.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white       \n  mb-4\">7. Termination and Suspension</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-3\">\n          <p>Genospark reserves the right to suspend or terminate your    \n   account and access to the Services, without prior notice or\n  liability, for any reason, including:</p>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 ml-6 list-disc list-inside\">\n            <li>Breach of these Terms, especially violating Section 4     \n  (IP Rights).</li>\n            <li>Non-payment of applicable fees.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white       \n  mb-4\">8. Limitation of Liability and Indemnification</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>\n            <strong>Limitation of Liability:</strong> To the maximum      \n  extent permitted by applicable law, Genospark, its founder,\n  officers, employees, or agents shall not be liable to you or any        \n  third party for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or    \n   punitive damages, including loss of profits, data, use, or\n  goodwill, resulting from your access to or use of, or inability to      \n  access or use, the Services.\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            <strong>Indemnification:</strong> You agree to defend,        \n  indemnify, and hold Genospark harmless from and against any claims,     \n  liabilities, damages, and expenses (including legal fees) arising       \n  out of your access to or use of the Services or your violation of       \n  these Terms.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white       \n  mb-4\">9. Modifications to Terms</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          <p>\n            Genospark reserves the right to modify or replace these       \n  Terms at any time at its sole discretion. We will alert you about       \n  any changes by updating the \"Effective Date.\" Your continued use of     \n  the Services after the Effective Date constitutes your acceptance of    \n   the changes.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white       \n  mb-4\">10. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          <p>\n            These Terms and your use of the Services shall be governed    \n   by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes    \n   arising under these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive\n  jurisdiction of the courts located in Chennai, India.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white       \n  mb-4\">11. External Links and Third-Party Services</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          <p>\n            The Services may contain links to third-party websites or     \n  services (e.g., payment processors). Genospark does not control\n  these and is not responsible for their content or terms of use. Your    \n   interaction with any third-party link is at your own risk.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white       \n  mb-4\">12. Contact Information</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          <p>\n            For any questions, concerns, or notices regarding these       \n  Terms, please contact us at: <a href=\"mailto:contact@genospark.in\"      \n  class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\n  hover:underline\">contact@genospark.in</a>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,4,'2025-10-05 09:17:06','2025-10-05 13:22:28'),(53,46,'HERO','Refund Policy Header','<header class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 py-12 px-6 border-b\n  border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900\n  dark:text-white\">Refund Policy</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">GenoSpark Digital\n  Purchase Refund Policy</p>\n      <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\n  mt-2\">Effective Date: 1st December 2025</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>','IMAGE','https://ik.imagekit.io/genospark/section_media_1759678785123_gs_refund__2__0vUCm918-.png',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,4,'2025-10-05 15:13:59','2025-10-05 15:39:51'),(54,46,'MIDDLE','Refund Policy Content','<main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12\">\n    <div class=\"prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-none\n  space-y-8\">\n\n      <section>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>\n            At <strong>Genospark Innovative Solutions Pvt.\n  Ltd.</strong>, we provide premium digital exam preparation products.\n   This policy applies specifically to our paid products:\n  <strong>Practice Tests</strong> (1-5 sets) and <strong>Near\n  Real-Time Exam Simulators</strong> (1-2 sets).\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 p-4 rounded-lg\n  border-l-4 border-blue-500\">\n            <p>\n              <strong>Please Note:</strong> Our complimentary\n  offerings, including the <strong>Mock Tests</strong>, <strong>Cheat\n  Sheets</strong>, and <strong>Blogs</strong>, are provided free of\n  charge and are not subject to any refund under this policy.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <p>\n            This Refund Policy applies only to individual Users\n  purchasing access to our <strong>Practice Tests</strong> and/or\n  <strong>Near Real-Time Exam Simulators</strong> (\"Paid Exam Prep\n  Access\").\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            <strong>By purchasing Paid Exam Prep Access from\n  Genospark, you agree to this Refund Policy and our <a\n  href=\"https://genospark.in/terms\" class=\"text-blue-600\n  dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline\">Terms of Use</a>.</strong>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\n  mb-4\">1. Refund Eligibility for Paid Exam Prep Access</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>\n            We offer a brief <strong>48-Hour Satisfaction\n  Guarantee</strong> for all Paid Exam Prep Access purchased. This\n  limited window reflects the immediate, high-value nature of the\n  proprietary test content.\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n            <table class=\"w-full border-collapse border\n  border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr class=\"bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800\">\n                  <th class=\"border border-gray-300\n  dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold\">Criteria for\n   Refund Request</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-gray-300\n  dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold\">Refund\n  Value</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300\n  dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\"><strong>Within 48 Hours of Purchase\n  Time</strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300\n  dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\n  font-semibold\">100% Refund</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300\n  dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\"><strong>After 48 Hours of Purchase\n  Time</strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300\n  dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\n  font-semibold\">No Refund</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 p-4 rounded-lg\n  border-l-4 border-amber-500 mt-6\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\n  dark:text-white mb-2\">Crucial Usage Condition for All Refunds:</h3>\n            <p class=\"mb-2\">\n              Refund requests submitted within the 48-hour window will\n   be <strong>void</strong> if the following usage threshold has been\n  met:\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              <strong>Attempted Exams:</strong> The User has\n  <strong>initiated or attempted any Practice Test or Near Real-Time\n  Exam Simulator</strong> included in the purchase. Initiating an\n  attempt on <em>any</em> paid product is considered full usage due to\n   the immediate exposure of proprietary questions and logic.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\n  mb-4\">2. Grounds for Automatic Refund Denial</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>A refund will <strong>not</strong> be granted under any\n  circumstance if the User:</p>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 ml-6 list-disc list-inside\">\n            <li>\n              <strong>Achieved Certification:</strong> Successfully\n  passes the official vendor certification exam related to the\n  purchased content.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <strong>Content Misuse:</strong> Is found to be in\n  violation of the Genospark Terms of Use, including unauthorized\n  screen-sharing, copying, or distribution of our proprietary\n  simulation or practice questions.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <strong>Promotional Purchases:</strong> The purchase was\n   made during a heavily discounted promotional sale where the\n  non-refundable status was clearly stated at the point of sale.\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\n  mb-4\">3. How to Initiate a Refund Request</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>To initiate a refund request, please send an email with\n  the following mandatory details:</p>\n          <ol class=\"space-y-2 ml-6 list-decimal list-inside\">\n            <li><strong>Subject Line:</strong> PAID EXAM PREP REFUND\n  REQUEST - [Your Order ID Number]</li>\n            <li><strong>Registered Email:</strong> The email address\n  used for your Genospark account.</li>\n            <li><strong>Product Name:</strong> The specific Practice\n  Test package and/or Exam Simulator purchased.</li>\n            <li><strong>Reason:</strong> A concise explanation for the\n   refund request.</li>\n          </ol>\n          <p class=\"mt-4\">\n            Send your refund request to: <a\n  href=\"mailto:contact@genospark.in\" class=\"text-blue-600\n  dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline\n  font-semibold\">contact@genospark.in</a>\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            We commit to reviewing your request within <strong>10\n  business days</strong> and processing all approved refunds back to\n  your original payment method.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\n  mb-4\">Contact Us</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          <p>\n            For any questions regarding this policy, please contact us\n   at <strong><a href=\"mailto:contact@genospark.in\"\n  class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\n  hover:underline\">contact@genospark.in</a></strong> or visit our\n  <strong><a href=\"https://genospark.in/contact-us\"\n  class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline\">Contact Us\n  Page</a></strong>.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,4,'2025-10-05 15:13:59','2025-10-05 15:39:51'),(55,47,'HERO','Privacy Policy Header','<header class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 py-12 px-6 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Privacy Policy</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">GenoSpark Innovative Solutions Pvt. Ltd.</p>\n      <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2\">Effective Date: 1st December 2025</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>','IMAGE','https://ik.imagekit.io/genospark/section_media_1759689115622_gs_privacy__2__np8ZTCl9e.png',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,4,'2025-10-05 18:30:11','2025-10-05 18:32:00'),(56,47,'MIDDLE','Privacy Policy Content','<main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12\">\n    <div class=\"prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8\">\n\n      <section>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>\n            This Privacy Policy describes how Genospark Innovative Solutions Pvt. Ltd. (\"Genospark,\"       \n  \"We,\" \"Us,\" or \"Our\"), collects, uses, processes, and protects the personal information of users\n  (\"User,\" \"You,\" or \"Your\") who access our websites, digital platforms, and services, including our       \n  Paid Exam Prep Access (Practice Tests and Final Test Simulators), Free Digital Products (Mock Tests,     \n  Cheat Sheets, Blogs), and Professional Development Programs (SAP).\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            By using our Services, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance        \n  with this policy and our <strong><a href=\"https://genospark.in/terms\" class=\"text-blue-600\n  dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline\">Terms of Use</a></strong>.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">1. Information We\n  Collect</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>\n            We collect information that allows us to provide, improve, and protect our Services. The       \n  types of information we collect fall into the following categories:\n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">A. Information You        \n  Provide Directly</h3>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 ml-6 list-disc list-inside\">\n              <li>\n                <strong>Account and Identity Data:</strong> When you register for an account or enroll     \n  in a service, we collect your name, email address, phone number, and physical address.\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <strong>Payment Data:</strong> When you make a purchase, we collect necessary\n  transactional information. We do not store full credit card details; this information is securely        \n  processed by our third-party payment processors (e.g., Razorpay, PayPal). We receive limited data        \n  such as transaction ID, payment status, and the last four digits of your card/account for\n  verification.\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <strong>Communication Data:</strong> Information you provide when contacting us for        \n  support (via email at <a href=\"mailto:contact@genospark.in\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400      \n  hover:underline\">contact@genospark.in</a> or through the <a href=\"https://genospark.in/contact-us\"       \n  class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline\">Contact Page</a>), providing feedback on        \n  content accuracy, or participating in surveys.\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">B. Information\n  Collected Automatically</h3>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 ml-6 list-disc list-inside\">\n              <li>\n                <strong>Usage and Performance Data:</strong> We track your activity within our\n  platform, including which practice tests you attempt, time spent on the Final Test Simulator, modules    \n   accessed, pages viewed, and course completion status. This data is essential for delivering the\n  Service and verifying product usage for refund purposes (as outlined in our <a\n  href=\"https://genospark.in/refund-policy\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\n  hover:underline\">Refund Policy</a>).\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <strong>Device and Log Data:</strong> We collect information about the device you use      \n  to access our Services, including your IP address, browser type, operating system, and unique device     \n  identifiers.\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <strong>Cookies and Tracking:</strong> We use cookies and similar tracking technologies    \n   (like Google Analytics) to track activity on our Services, measure performance, and enhance user        \n  experience. You can control cookie preferences through your browser settings.\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">2. How We Use Your\n  Information</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>\n\n          <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n            <table class=\"w-full border-collapse border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr class=\"bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800\">\n                  <th class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3 text-left\n  font-semibold\">Purpose of Use</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3 text-left\n  font-semibold\">Details</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3 text-left\n  font-semibold\">Legal Basis (India)</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\"><strong>Service        \n  Provision & Fulfillment</strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">To create your user    \n   account, provide access to purchased Practice Tests and Final Test Simulators, and deliver Free\n  Digital Products.</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">Necessary for the      \n  performance of a contract (Terms of Use).</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\"><strong>Payment        \n  Processing</strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">To process\n  purchases securely and manage transactions.</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">Necessary for the      \n  performance of a contract.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\"><strong>Customer       \n  Support & Feedback</strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">To respond to your     \n  support inquiries, manage feedback on content accuracy, and implement necessary corrections as\n  detailed in our Terms of Use (Section 5).</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">Legitimate\n  interest; Necessary for the performance of a contract.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\"><strong>Service        \n  Improvement & Analytics</strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">To monitor and\n  analyze usage patterns (e.g., test attempt rates) to improve content quality, platform performance,      \n  and business development.</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">Legitimate\n  interest.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\"><strong>Legal &        \n  Security</strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">To prevent\n  unauthorized access, detect fraudulent activity, enforce our Terms of Use (especially against content    \n   sharing), and comply with legal obligations.</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">Necessary for legal    \n   compliance and legitimate interest (security).</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\"><strong>Marketing      \n  and Communication</strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">To send you\n  updates, promotional offers, and information about new certification products, provided you have not     \n  opted out.</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 px-4 py-3\">Consent; Legitimate    \n   interest.</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">3. How We Share Your\n  Information</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>\n            We do not sell your personal information. We share your data only in the following limited     \n  circumstances:\n          </p>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 ml-6 list-disc list-inside\">\n            <li>\n              <strong>Third-Party Service Providers:</strong> We share necessary data with third\n  parties who perform services on our behalf, such as:\n              <ul class=\"space-y-1 ml-6 mt-2 list-circle list-inside\">\n                <li><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> To securely handle payment transactions.</li>     \n                <li><strong>Cloud Hosting Providers:</strong> To securely store our data and host the      \n  platform.</li>\n                <li><strong>Analytics Providers (e.g., Google Analytics):</strong> To analyze website      \n  and platform usage.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <strong>Professional Development Programs (SAP):</strong> If you enroll in the SAP\n  program, information may be shared with our network of mentors or recruitment partners to provide the    \n   contracted career support. This is only done with your explicit participation in the program.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> We may disclose your information when legally required    \n   to do so to comply with applicable laws, government requests, judicial proceedings, court orders, or    \n   legal processes (especially under the jurisdiction of Chennai, India).\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In the event of a merger, acquisition, or sale of       \n  assets, your information may be transferred to the new entity.\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">4. Data Security and\n  International Transfer</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">A. Data Security</h3>     \n            <p>\n              We implement reasonable and appropriate security measures, including encryption and\n  secure protocols, to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or     \n  destruction. However, no internet transmission or electronic storage is completely secure, and we        \n  cannot guarantee absolute security.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">B. International Data     \n  Transfer</h3>\n            <p>\n              As a company operating under Indian law, your data is primarily stored and processed on      \n  servers located in India or on global cloud infrastructure chosen by Genospark. By using our\n  Services, you consent to the transfer of your information to these locations.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">5. Your Data Protection\n  Rights</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>\n            You have the right to access, correct, delete, or restrict the use of your personal data,      \n  subject to local laws and contractual obligations. Specifically:\n          </p>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 ml-6 list-disc list-inside\">\n            <li>\n              <strong>Access and Correction:</strong> You may review and change your personal\n  information by logging into your account settings or contacting us.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <strong>Opt-Out:</strong> You can opt-out of receiving marketing emails from us by\n  clicking the \"unsubscribe\" link in those emails.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <strong>Data Retention:</strong> We retain your personal data for as long as your account    \n   is active or as needed to provide you with Services, comply with legal and regulatory obligations,      \n  and enforce our agreements.\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">6. Age Restriction and\n  Children\'s Privacy</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4\">\n          <p>\n            As stated in our Terms of Use (Section 1.1), our Services are not directed to individuals      \n  under the age of 18.\n          </p>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 ml-6 list-disc list-inside\">\n            <li>\n              <strong>Users under 13:</strong> We strictly prohibit the use of our Services by anyone      \n  under the age of 13.\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <strong>Users 13-18:</strong> If you are between 13 and 18, you may only use the Services    \n   with the explicit consent and supervision of a parent or legal guardian who agrees to our Terms. If     \n  we learn that we have collected personal data from a child under 13 without verifiable parental\n  consent, we will take steps to delete the information promptly.\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">7. Changes to This Privacy       \n  Policy</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          <p>\n            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version will be indicated     \n  by an updated \"Effective Date\" and will be effective as soon as it is accessible. We encourage you to    \n   review this policy frequently.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">8. Contact Us</h2>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2\">\n          <p>\n            If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our practices regarding your    \n   data, please contact us at:\n          </p>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-1 ml-6 list-none\">\n            <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:contact@genospark.in\" class=\"text-blue-600\n  dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline\">contact@genospark.in</a></li>\n            <li><strong>Visit:</strong> <a href=\"https://genospark.in/contact-us\" class=\"text-blue-600     \n  dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline\">Contact Us Page</a></li>\n            <li><strong>Jurisdiction:</strong> All matters related to this policy are governed by the      \n  laws of India and subject to the jurisdiction of the courts in Chennai, India.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,4,'2025-10-05 18:30:11','2025-10-05 18:32:00'),(58,49,'HERO','CUSP++ — Advanced Data & Cloud Specialization',NULL,'IMAGE','https://ik.imagekit.io/genospark/section_media_1761396408218_gs_cusp___24Oct_Tx_m98Q2K.webp',NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,2,'2025-10-23 17:25:25','2025-10-25 12:46:52'),(59,49,'MIDDLE','CUSP++ - Shaping Specialists','<section class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 py-16\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n    <!-- Main Title -->\n    <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">\n      CUSP++ — Advanced Data & Cloud Specialization\n    </h1>\n\n    \n\n    <!-- Description -->\n    <p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n      <strong>CUSP++</strong> is designed for students who have completed the CUSP program and want to specialize in \n      <strong>Data Engineering, Data Analytics, Data Visualization, and AI/ML</strong>. This program focuses on \n      real-world, hands-on projects and advanced cloud tools to prepare students for high-demand careers in data and AI.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,2,'2025-10-23 17:25:26','2025-10-26 14:47:00'),(60,49,'MIDDLE','What You Will Learn','<section class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 py-16\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n      What You Will Learn\n    </h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4\">\n    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n      <div class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow hover:shadow-lg transition\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white mb-2\">Data Engineering</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          Build robust ETL pipelines, manage data lakes and warehouses, and work with large-scale cloud data platforms.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow hover:shadow-lg transition\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white mb-2\">Data Analytics</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">\n          Analyze complex datasets, extract 