Exam Content:</strong> Help us design near real-time exam simulations and question banks that reflect true industry challenges.</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <span><strong>Contribute to Learning Paths:</strong> Collaborate on course design and curriculum refinement for evolving technologies.</span>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n                    Be part of a global learning ecosystem that values your expertise.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                    💡 Connect with us to become a knowledge contributor.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>',NULL,NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,22,4,'2025-10-24 20:40:03','2025-10-25 17:41:01'),(68,50,'MIDDLE','For Mock Interviewers','<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6\" style=\"margin-top: 3rem;\">\n    <section class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 border\n  border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 p-2 rounded-lg\">\n                <span class=\"material-icons text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\"\n      style=\"font-size: 28px;\">business_center</span>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2\">For Mock Interviewers</h2>\n                \n                <span class=\"block text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2\">Turn your experience into impact.</span>\n                \n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n                    If you have strong interview experience in: Cloud (AWS, Azure, GCP), Programming (Java, Python, C++, etc.), AI/ML, Big Data, Security, Snowflake, and more, you can join our Mock Interviewer Panel to:\n                </p>\n                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2 mb-4\">\n                    <li>\n                        <span><strong>Conduct Certification or Client Interview simulations:</strong> Help learners build real-world confidence.</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <span><strong>Get paid for each session you conduct.</strong></span>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n                    All you need to do: Submit your profile, areas of expertise, and preferred availability slots.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                    🎯 Become a certified mock interviewer and mentor the next wave of professionals.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>',NULL,NULL,NULL,6,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,22,4,'2025-10-24 20:41:46','2025-10-25 17:41:01'),(69,50,'MIDDLE','For Investors','<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6\" style=\"margin-top: 3rem;\">\n    <section class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 border\n  border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 p-2 rounded-lg\">\n                <span class=\"material-icons text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\"\n      style=\"font-size: 28px;\">monetization_on</span>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2\">For Investors</h2>\n                \n                <span class=\"block text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2\">Invest early. Grow with the next big thing in EdTech. Genospark is redefining certification learning and professional growth.</span>\n                \n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n                    Investors passionate about EdTech, AI-driven learning, and real-time skill assessment can:\n                </p>\n                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2 mb-4\">\n                    <li>\n                        <span><strong>Partner with us</strong> in building innovative learning ecosystems.</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <span>Be part of an early-stage innovation startup with <strong>high growth potential</strong>.</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <span><strong>Co-create impact</strong> in the global upskilling and certification industry.</span>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                    🚀 Join us in shaping the future of tech learning and workforce development.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>',NULL,NULL,NULL,7,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,22,4,'2025-10-24 20:43:10','2025-10-25 17:41:01'),(70,50,'MIDDLE','Together, Let’s Build the Future of Learning','<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 4rem;\">\n    <section class=\"text-white rounded-xl shadow-xl p-6\"\n        style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(79, 70, 229), rgb(126, 34, 206));\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white/20 p-2 rounded-lg\">\n                <span class=\"material-icons text-white\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">handshake</span>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3\">Together, Let’s Build the Future of Learning</h2>\n                <p class=\"leading-relaxed text-indigo-100 mb-4\">\n                    At Genospark, we believe collaboration is the cornerstone of growth. Whether you’re educating, hiring, mentoring, or investing — your contribution can shape thousands of careers.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"leading-relaxed text-indigo-100 mb-4\">\n                    📩 Contact us today — and let’s make a lasting impact together.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"leading-relaxed text-indigo-100\">\n                    For collaboration opportunities (Corporate, University, Mock Interviewer, or Investor), please email us directly at\n                    <br />📧 <a href=\"mailto:contact@genospark.in\" class=\"font-semibold underline hover:text-white\">contact@genospark.in</a>\n                    <br /><span class=\"text-sm\">(Please mention your collaboration type in the subject line — e.g., “Corporate Partnership” or “Investor Inquiry”)</span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>',NULL,NULL,NULL,8,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,22,4,'2025-10-24 20:45:38','2025-10-25 17:41:01'),(77,44,'MIDDLE','Reach out','<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4rem;\">\n  <section class=\"text-white rounded-xl shadow-xl p-6\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(16, 185, 129), rgb(5, 150, 105));\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n      <div class=\"bg-white/20 p-2 rounded-lg\">\n        <span class=\"material-icons text-white\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">mail</span>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3\">Get in Touch</h2>\n        <p class=\"leading-relaxed mb-4\" style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\">\n          Ready to join our team? Send your profile, resume, and a brief introduction to:\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"mailto:contact@genospark.in\" \n           class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white px-5 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-200\"\n           style=\"color: #059669;\">\n          <span class=\"material-icons\" style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #059669;\">send</span>\n          contact@genospark.in\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>',NULL,NULL,NULL,6,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,4,'2025-10-27 15:39:01','2025-10-27 15:42:34');
